<td id="S4.T1.5.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.5pt 20.0pt;">  55K</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.5.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.5.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.5pt 20.0pt;" rowspan="3">  <span id="S4.T1.5.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text">SophiaVL-R1</span></td>
