<td id="S4.T1.5.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.5pt 20.0pt;" rowspan="2">  <span id="S4.T1.5.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_text">Mantis-Instruct</span></td>
